# Gateway Sneak ({2}{U}, Black Lotus's {U}{U}{U}): when Bot1 plays Talon Gates of Madara, a Gate, "this creature can't be blocked this turn"
# (CR 603.2, 509.1b), so Bot2's Ornithopter cannot block it (a refusal); it deals 1 combat damage to Bot2 (20 -> 19) and "draw a card"
# (hand 5 after playing the Talon -> 6).

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Gateway Sneak
Talon Gates of Madara
Plains x4
Plains x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Blue)
Bot1.Hand.Gateway Sneak.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Talon Gates of Madara.Play
Bot1.Target()
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Pass
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 5
Bot1.Attack(Gateway Sneak > Bot2)
! Bot2.Block(Ornithopter > Gateway Sneak)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
? Bot2.Life = 19
? Bot1.Hand.Count = 6

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 19
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
